    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Runtime-facing surface for the editor-only shared Tryll connection/session. UTryllEditorSubsystem (TryllClientEditor) registers an implementation so <ref refid="class_u_tryll_subsystem" kindref="compound">UTryllSubsystem</ref> (TryllClient) can share the editor connection in PIE without linking the editor module. Per-message calls are not forwarded: the game subsystem uses <ref refid="class_i_tryll_editor_bridge_1a66b0dd0a3b313fbf6dc84ea2c101f63a" kindref="member">GetSharedConnection()</ref> and its own completions. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
